.* FILE: the task menu for files.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='FILE'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=FILE HELP=HLPFILE KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Files
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?WRKF'.Work with files
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?SAVOBJ OBJTYPE(*FILE)'.Save a file
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?RSTOBJ OBJTYPE(*FILE)'.Restore a file
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?STRSEU'.Edit a source file
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU IDDU'.Interactive Data Definition Utility (IDDU)
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='MENU QUERY'.Query Utilities
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?STRDFU'.Data File Utility (DFU)
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD STRSQL'.Interactive SQL
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD STRPGMMNU'.Programmer menu
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?DSPF'.Display a stream file or database file
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='CMD ?EDTF'.Edit a stream file or database file
:MENUI OPTION=60 ACTION='MENU FILE2'.More file options
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPFILE.Files - Help
:P.Database and source files: list, save, restore, edit and query them.
Option 60 shows more.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
